{"PageNumber":405,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":30,"SurahIndex":"030","VerseNumber":6,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَعۡدَ ٱللَّهِۖ لَا يُخۡلِفُ ٱللَّهُ وَعۡدَهُۥ وَلَٰكِنَّ أَكۡثَرَ ٱلنَّاسِ لَا يَعۡلَمُونَ","TajweedText":"وَعْدَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ‌ۖ لَا يُخْلِفُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهُ وَعْدَهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> وَلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>كِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ أَكْثَرَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed><tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َاسِ لَا يَعْلَم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٦</span>","End":"٦","PageNumber":405,"JuzNumber":21,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":349,"MaqraNumber":162,"HizbNumber":41,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":30,"SurahIndex":"030","VerseNumber":7,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"يَعۡلَمُونَ ظَٰهِرٗا مِّنَ ٱلۡحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنۡيَا وَهُمۡ عَنِ ٱلۡأٓخِرَةِ هُمۡ غَٰفِلُونَ","TajweedText":"يَعْلَمُونَ ظَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هِ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>رًا م</tajweed>ِّنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْحَيَ<tajweed class=slnt>و</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_normal>ٲ</tajweed>ةِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>دُّنْيَا وَهُمْ عَنِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَخِرَةِ هُمْ غَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>فِل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٧</span>","End":"٧","PageNumber":405,"JuzNumber":21,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":349,"MaqraNumber":162,"HizbNumber":41,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":30,"SurahIndex":"030","VerseNumber":8,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَوَلَمۡ يَتَفَكَّرُواْ فِيٓ أَنفُسِهِمۗ مَّا خَلَقَ ٱللَّهُ ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ وَٱلۡأَرۡضَ وَمَا بَيۡنَهُمَآ إِلَّا بِٱلۡحَقِّ وَأَجَلٖ مُّسَمّٗىۗ وَإِنَّ كَثِيرٗا مِّنَ ٱلنَّاسِ بِلِقَآيِٕ رَبِّهِمۡ لَكَٰفِرُونَ","Ta